  "sourceText": "Classic Margarita\nBy: Sheri Wetherell\nPublished: Thursday, February 11, 2010 - 7:07pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 ounces Tequila\n1 ounce Cointreau\n1 ounce lime juice\n1/2 teapoon simple syrup\nIce\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In a cocktail shaker combine all ingredients with ice and shake vigorously. Strain into a salt rimmed stemware glass. No garnish necessary.",
